&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI in Applications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Artificial Intelligence can be a useful tool to support your application, however, all examples and statements provided must be truthful, factually accurate and taken directly from your own experience. Where plagiarism has been identified (presenting the ideas and experiences of others, or generated by artificial intelligence, as your own) applications may be withdrawn and internal candidates may be subject to disciplinary action. Please see our&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://eur02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.civil-service-careers.gov.uk%2Fartificial-intelligence-and-recruitment%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CLynn.Tan%40dsit.gov.uk%7Ccf5d753b7f19427afc8f08de4c307014%7Ccbac700502c143ebb497e6492d1b2dd8%7C0%7C0%7C639031968075235036%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=jCrYoy62YfXN%2FLIB%2FhtHxdLGbCOgropbkZXDyQsUMC4%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;02db05e7-03ca-4ca6-bcd9-73ff8bf258f2&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;1&quot;&gt;candidate guidance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;for more information on appropriate and inappropriate use.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI tools in recruitment&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We may use AI tools to help our hiring team review applications, for example by summarising application materials and helping us prioritise them against the published criteria. We do not use AI tools to find information about you from other sources, including online.&amp;nbsp;People make every decision. We do not make solely automated decisions about candidates. Find out more, including your rights, in our recruitment privacy notice: https://www.aisi.gov.uk/careers/privacy-policy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal Fraud Database&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;The Internal Fraud function of the Fraud, Error, Debt and Grants Function at the Cabinet Office processes details of civil servants who have been dismissed for committing internal fraud, or who would have been dismissed had they not resigned. The Cabinet Office receives the details from participating government organisations of civil servants who have been dismissed, or who would have been dismissed had they not resigned, for internal fraud. In instances such as this, civil servants are then banned for 5 years from further employment in the civil service. The Cabinet Office then processes this data and discloses a limited dataset back to DLUHC as a participating government organisations. DLUHC then carry out the pre employment checks so as to detect instances where known fraudsters are attempting to reapply for roles in the civil service. In this way, the policy is ensured and the repetition of internal fraud is prevented.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;For more information please see -&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/internal-fraud-register-privacy-notice/internal-fraud-register-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Internal Fraud Register.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Successful candidates must undergo a criminal record check and get&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/government-baseline-personnel-security-standard&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/government-baseline-personnel-security-standard&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;baseline personnel security standard (BPSS)&amp;nbsp;clearance&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;before they can be appointed. Additionally, there is a strong preference for eligibility for&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/national-security-vetting-advice-for-people-who-are-being-vetted&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/national-security-vetting-advice-for-people-who-are-being-vetted&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;counter-terrorist check (CTC)&amp;nbsp;clearance&lt;/a&gt;. Some roles may require higher levels of clearance, and we will state this by exception in the job advertisement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/vetting-explained-and-our-vetting-charter/the-vetting-charter&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/vetting-explained-and-our-vetting-charter/the-vetting-charter&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;See our vetting charter here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;vac_display_field&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Nationality requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;We may be able to offer roles to applicant from &lt;strong&gt;any nationality or background&lt;/strong&gt;. As such we encourage you to apply even if you do not meet the standard &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/nationality-rules&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;nationality requirements (opens in a new window).&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;vac_display_field&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Working for the Civil Service&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;vac_display_field&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;vac_display_field_value&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;The&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://civilservicecommission.independent.gov.uk/code/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Civil Service Code (opens in a new window)&lt;/a&gt; sets out the standards of behaviour expected of civil servants.&amp;nbsp;The Civil Service embraces diversity and promotes equal opportunities. As such, we run a Disability Confident Scheme (DCS) for candidates with disabilities who meet the minimum selection criteria.&amp;nbsp;The Civil Service also offers a Redeployment Interview Scheme to civil servants who are at risk of redundancy, and who meet the minimum requirements for the advertised vacancy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;vac_display_field&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;vac_display_field_value&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;The Civil Service is committed to attract, retain and invest in talent wherever it is found. To learn more please see the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/civil-service-people-plan-2024-2027/civil-service-people-plan-2024-2027-html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Civil Service People Plan (opens in a new window)&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/civil-service-diversity-and-inclusion-strategy-2022-to-2025&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Civil Service Diversity and Inclusion Strategy (opens in a new window)&lt;/a&gt;. As part of the application process, we monitor statistics on D&amp;amp;I. You can see how we process this data here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/government-digital-service-recruitment-privacy-notice/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment privacy notice - GOV.UK&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Security Engineering  London

Software Engineer - Red Team &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the AI Security Institute&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AI Security Institute is the world&#39;s largest and best-funded team dedicated to understanding advanced AI risks and translating that knowledge into action. We’re in the heart of the UK government with direct lines to No. 10 (the Prime Minister&#39;s office), and we work with frontier developers and governments globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re here because governments are critical for advanced AI going well, and UK AISI is uniquely positioned to mobilise them. With our resources, unique agility and international influence, this is the best place to shape both AI development and government action.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;vac_display_field&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;vac_display_field_value&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;vac_display_field&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;vac_display_field_value&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The deadline for applying to this role is Tuesday 8th December,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;end of day, anywhere on Earth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Red Team conducts cutting-edge research to identify, evaluate and stress test vulnerabilities in frontier AI systems, sharing our findings directly with leading AI companies, UK officials and allied governments. Our work shapes how the most powerful AI systems are deployed - you can read about it in the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/24/technology/uk-ai-safety-institute.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.economist.com/britain/2026/02/19/britain-is-the-closest-the-world-has-to-an-ai-safety-inspector&quot;&gt;The Economist,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.telegraph.co.uk/news/2026/04/22/32-year-old-wunderkind-preparing-britain-ai-attack/&quot;&gt;The Telegraph&lt;/a&gt;. Demand for this work is growing faster than we can currently meet - we&#39;re scaling to address that gap.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Red Team’s work is crucial to ensuring advanced AI systems are developed and deployed safely. We are composed of three specialised sub-teams:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;24&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Misuse&lt;/strong&gt;: stress-testing and jailbreaking safeguards against misuse of dangerous capabilities (e.g. our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aisi.gov.uk/blog/how-were-working-with-frontier-ai-developers-to-improve-model-security&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;safeguard testing with Anthropic and OpenAI,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; and recent work on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aisi.gov.uk/blog/boundary-point-jailbreaking-a-new-way-to-break-the-strongest-ai-defences&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Boundary Point Jailbreaking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aisi.gov.uk/research/stack-adversarial-attacks-on-llm-safeguard-pipelines&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;attacks on layered safeguard systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aisi.gov.uk/blog/principles-for-safeguard-evaluation&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;principles for evaluating misuse safeguards&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;24&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;detecting and understanding misalignment and loss-of-control risks (e.g., &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aisi.gov.uk/research/evaluating-whether-gpt-6-astra-performs-unsanctioned-supply-chain-attacks&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;our evaluation of GPT-6 Astra&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aisi.gov.uk/blog/cheating-behaviour-in-frontier-model-evaluations&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;our research into cheating behaviour in frontier model evaluations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;24&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Control&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aisi.gov.uk/blog/how-our-new-control-red-team-is-stress-testing-frontier-monitors&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;stress-testing measures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; that identify and prevent agents taking harmful actions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While each team has its own focus, we share methodologies, infrastructure and tooling across the wider team. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW8223072 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW8223072 BCX8&quot;&gt;Role Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW8223072 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for motivated and talented Software Engineers to join the Red Team. We are seeking exceptional candidates at all experience levels, from junior through to senior, staff and principal levels.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are particularly interested in candidates who:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked closely with research teams, understanding their needs, building tools they want to use, and automating their workflows.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a good understanding of frontier AI capabilities, limitations, and risks and how they can be leveraged for automation at scale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have built infrastructure that works at scale, with a high bar for security. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with serving and training models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;vac_display_field&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW36642482 BCX8&quot;&gt;What &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW36642482 BCX8&quot;&gt;you’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW36642482 BCX8&quot;&gt; be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;vac_display_field&quot;&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;vac_display_field_value&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a software engineer on one of our sub teams, you might: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain systems for running red-teaming against frontier models at scale, such as automated jailbreaking pipelines, alignment auditor agents in Inspect Petri, and attacker agents for control red-teaming&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement systems for running large scale automated research and engineering with many agents on AISI’s research platform&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend our evaluation tooling, built on Inspect (AISI&#39;s open-source framework for evaluating AI), to new kinds of targets&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop novel solutions to performance, reliability, and security problems that arise from running thousands of agents in parallel&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Core Technology to share infrastructure and avoid duplicating work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help run pre-release testing of frontier models, often to tight deadlines&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debug problems as they come up and make sure results are reliable and reproducible&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn loosely defined research ideas into well-tested, documented and maintainable code&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review code, share knowledge and help researchers write better software&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Person specification&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;vac_display_field&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;vac_display_field_value&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You may be a good fit if you have some of the following skills, experience and attitudes:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Writing production quality code at fast pace.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in developing ways to automate work with agents, while accounting for their limitations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing, shipping, and maintaining complex tech products.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improving technical standards across a team, through mentoring and feedback.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating effectively with many people, including external teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with a world-class research team comprised of both scientists and engineers (e.g. in a top-3 lab).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and maintaining systems on AWS or other cloud providers using infrastructure-as-code.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;vac_display_field&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Highly Desirable&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We additionally may factor in experience with particular areas like:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in Cloud Infrastructure or Dev Ops (AWS, Azure, Kubernetes, Terraform, CDK, Docker, etc.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cybersecurity expertise&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ML Ops (vLLM, agent frameworks, fine-tuning, RAG systems, etc.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with red teaming, adversarial machine learning, or offensive or adversarial security (for example penetration testing or capture-the-flag competitions)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with large language model APIs and the tools around them, such as OpenAI-compatible APIs, agent frameworks or vLLM&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building, running or analysing AI evaluations, ideally with Inspect&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud infrastructure and DevOps experience with AWS, Kubernetes, Docker, Terraform or similar&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with how AI could be misused or could slip out of human control, and how safeguards try to prevent this&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;vac_display_field&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;This might not be the role for you if:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You prefer working on production-grade software and would find rapid prototyping or &quot;good enough for now&quot; code frustrating&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You prefer well-defined requirements and long planning cycles. Our priorities shift as new models are released, and our projects often run to tight deadlines.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW267258098 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot; data-ccp-charstyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;ac0262f4-8a9e-5820-b908-2d943c5f7113|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Aptos,Arial&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;24&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;normaltextrun&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;normaltextrun&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Default Paragraph Font&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;Selection&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentStart ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed CommentHighlightPipeRest CommentHighlightRest SCXW267258098 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The interview process may vary from candidate to candidate, however, you should expect a typical process to include some technical proficiency tests, discussions with a cross-section of our team at AISI (including non-technical staff) and conversations with your team lead. The process will culminate in a conversation with members of the senior leadership team here at AISI.      &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates should expect to go through &lt;strong&gt;some or all&lt;/strong&gt; of the following stages once an application has been submitted:      &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initial assessment   &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initial screening call     &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical assessment  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Behavioural interview   &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final interview with members of the senior leadership team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
