Senior Global Rider Escalations Representative &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a talented person to join the Global Escalations department, a bustling and vibrant team who support riders with various escalated contact reasons. This is the perfect opportunity to join an exciting, fast-growing business and expand your operational abilities, whilst supporting riders when they need our support the most. You will also work closely with our Restaurant, Customer and Legal teams to resolve incidents involving riders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting into the Rider Escalations Team Lead, you will be a key part of the team that ensures we are providing best in class support to our Riders, Customers and Restaurants. As a Senior Rep, you will work on escalated incidents, as well as supporting the team to drive improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing support to riders via email and sometimes over the phone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reviewing incident reports and making decisions on rider behaviour inline with our internal policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being a key point of contact with our stakeholders in Customer Care, Legal, Restaurant Support and Policy, as well as within the Rider Services Centre and Safety teams in all markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with our insurers and the police to resolve queries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responding to escalated queries, and supporting junior members of the team through more complex incidents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring our training materials and best practice guides are up to date&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carrying out regular quality calibrations to ensure compliance to procedures and process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying areas for improvement and working on those solutions with the Team Lead to increase team performance and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reviewing Supplier Agreement offboardings to enhance trust and transparency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working to ambitious targets while maintaining a high and consistent level of productivity and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Situations aren’t always clear cut, so you will need to be confident making decisions in line with our internal policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent Communicator&lt;/strong&gt;: You are confident and highly proficient in written and spoken English, as well as a second language (currently prioritising applicants who are proficient in written and spoken French, Italian or Cantonese)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organised&lt;/strong&gt;: You are detail-oriented and can prioritise the right work at the right time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative:&lt;/strong&gt; You enjoy working with others in a fast-changing environment with ambitious targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inquisitive: You are curious and can challenge processes that aren’t working -- you get to the bottom of things&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptable&lt;/strong&gt;: You are creative, resourceful and comfortable making decisions with ambiguous information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Motivated&lt;/strong&gt;: You are enthusiastic, goal-oriented, and eager to always improve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical&lt;/strong&gt;: You are confident with data and familiar with Excel/Gsheets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empathetic:&lt;/strong&gt; You are keen to provide riders with world class support&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Desirable&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Zendesk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a university degree or equivalent experience (Prior experience in Customer Support preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Rider Services  London

Senior Consultant, Digital Strategy &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;About Baringa&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Baringa is a global consulting firm that partners with leaders to drive change and create value. With deep industry expertise, and enabled by advanced technology, the firm helps clients to deliver with greater confidence and certainty. With over 2,000 people across the UK, Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, the firm combines global insight with local understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The firm works across energy and resources, financial services, government and public sector, consumer products and retail, pharmaceuticals and life sciences, manufacturing, and technology, media and telecoms, with capabilities spanning strategy, transformation and operational excellence – all powered by advanced technology, data, AI and digital innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clients value Baringa’s collaborative approach and the way its teams integrate seamlessly – all working with a shared understanding of what matters most. The firm is known for its kind, curious experts who listen closely and care deeply about client success as they help clients transform energy markets, modernise financial platforms, expand telecoms and digital networks through advanced data analytics, enable digital services in government, and unlock growth in consumer sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Certified as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Great Place to Work &lt;/em&gt;around the world, Baringa has been recognised by the &lt;em&gt;Financial Times &lt;/em&gt;in 22 categories of its UK Leading Management Consultants rankings, and by &lt;em&gt;Forbes &lt;/em&gt;for four consecutive years as one of the World’s Best Management Consulting Firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our Digital and Technology (D&amp;amp;T) Strategy Practice are looking for an experienced Senior Consultants to join the team.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In our Digital and Technology (D&amp;amp;T) Strategy Practice we bring strategy to life, enabling our clients to unlock the true meaning of Digital and the underlying technologies, allowing them to benefit from real innovative digital business models, helping them to be among the “first movers” and scale their digital ecosystem. &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are looking for more great people to join our Digital and Strategy practice; new colleagues with a passion for a high-performance culture, problem solving, enabling growth and delivering value through the use of technology to help CIOs deliver cost effective, positive and tailored user and customer experiences. &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our industry growth along with our continued progressive geographic expansion means that we can offer our employees great progression and development across a diverse range of engagements. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who can contribute to the success of the D&amp;amp;T Technology Strategy team and help build new capabilities, particularly around digital strategy, where technology connects with customer experience and engagement. You will be helping our clients transform their organisations, deploy new business models, optimise their IT spend, source better, improve ways of working, comply with regulation and exploit new digital technologies such as XaaS, cloud, artificial intelligence or the internet of things. &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;As well as spending time with our client’s teams to understand their strategy and technology concerns, you will be working with our subject matter experts across industry and technology sectors to ensure we bring our cutting edge thinking and expertise to our clients. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of digital and technology-enabled strategies and transformation roadmaps aligned to business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technology maturity assessments, providing strategic recommendations and improvement plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and oversee the implementation of digital and technology solutions to deliver measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage supplier and partner ecosystem activities, including vendor strategy, selection, and procurement support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate stakeholder engagement and define customer experience strategies with senior client leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and own business cases and investment recommendations to support technology and digital initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the optimisation of technology operating models, governance frameworks, and organisational capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive portfolio planning, IT investment prioritisation, cost optimisation, and benefits realisation activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage technology workstreams for M&amp;amp;A, post-merger integration (PMI), and separation programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the delivery of sustainable technology initiatives, while managing project teams, risks, and client relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
